 Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet The Girls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/b91c308965bd1d85bede114b86c6c711.poster.avif?t=1772333536\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/b91c308965bd1d85bede114b86c6c711.webm?t=1772333536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/b91c308965bd1d85bede114b86c6c711.mp4?t=1772333536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift on Destiny Line is a game where you determine the fate of your character in every way. Decide which type of girl or girls appeal to you. You have seven different options to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cassie</strong>: She seems sweet and outgoing on the outside, but she has some secrets. I can't give away any spoilers, but she works for someone big. She plays you like a toy, but it's a dangerous game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mia</strong>: She's carrying on her father's legacy at the repair shop. She has minor traumas and a sweet heart. She seems to trust you a little more quickly than she should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adhira</strong>: She likes to be in control. She enjoys racing and beating up guys who are too close to her. She cares deeply about her friends. It's up to you to soften her up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice</strong>: She loves playing video games and trying new things. She's always jumping on the line between social and antisocial. It's up to you to give her a lap to sit on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sarah</strong>: She's one of the most popular girls in school. She's confident and attractive. It looks like you'll have some trouble with her boyfriend. Will you be able to snatch her away from the school bully?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Penny</strong>: You two spent your childhood together, and I think she's platonically in love with you. She has trouble expressing herself and is hesitant to open up to you. It's up to you to help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gabrielle</strong>: Because of her oppressive family, she doesn't seem to have many friends. Her biggest dream is to become a ballerina, but she's too shy. She's a bit too naive, as she's clueless about many things, but she's definitely eager to learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive in to story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/1a3d209d84fe0912b6e07a825a4451cc.poster.avif?t=1772333536\" width=620 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/1a3d209d84fe0912b6e07a825a4451cc.webm?t=1772333536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/1a3d209d84fe0912b6e07a825a4451cc.mp4?t=1772333536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man born into a poor family. After facing his mother's death and his father's severe depression, he leaves home at university. He embarks on a university life in a distant city, but nothing turns out as he expected. He'll finally make a foray into the world of street racing, a world he's been fascinated with since childhood, and perhaps even become its king. We'll witness this young man, suddenly thrust into a different world, step by step. Along the way, he'll have a variety of experiences with a multitude of girls. Some will pursue him, while others will chase him. Will he find the right girl and commit to her? Or will he gather as many girls as he can and form a harem?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Currently Episode 1:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/58ea1c213c97d4e27caf602100c733d7.poster.avif?t=1772333536\" width=620 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/58ea1c213c97d4e27caf602100c733d7.webm?t=1772333536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/extras/58ea1c213c97d4e27caf602100c733d7.mp4?t=1772333536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1500+ Static images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Animated scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45+ Additional gallery images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 3 hours of experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Custom-composed music for the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ In-game sound effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chibi style achievements</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Attractive Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146490/d5406f59a13720740047a9dcea66cc2884f1886c/header.jpg?t=1772333536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+ or Kernel 3.x+ based distributions<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><